  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Force from right hand side liquid on left hand side liquid,<br /><br />(i) Due to surface tension force<br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mtext>=&nbsp;2RT</mtext></mrow> </math> (towards right)<br /><br />(ii) Due to liquid pressure force<br /><br /><math> <mo>=</mo><mfenced> <mrow> <msub> <mi>p</mi> <mn>0</mn> </msub> <mo>+</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow> </mfenced><mn>2</mn><mi>R</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi> </math><br /><br /><math> <mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>R</mi><msub> <mi>ρ</mi> <mn>0</mn> </msub> <mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>ρ</mi><mi>g</mi><msup> <mi>h</mi> <mn>2</mn> </msup> </math><br /><br />Net force is <math> <mrow> <mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"> <mrow> <mn>2</mn><msub> <mi>p</mi> <mi>o</mi> </msub> <mi>R</mi><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>g</mi><msup> <mi>h</mi> <mn>2</mn> </msup> <mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>R</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow> </mfenced></mrow> </math>",
